  "instructions": [
    "Heat butter in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add chicken and cook until browned, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "Add yuzu kosho, fish sauce, and brown sugar, and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in coconut cream and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and cook, covered, for 20 minutes, until chicken is cooked through.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot over rice or noodles."
